/**
 * ACADEMIC STRUCTURE · SECONDARY — Classes IX and X, in six sections.
 *
 * ═══ SOURCE OF TRUTH — every line traces to this repository ════════════════
 *   data/newsPages.ts
 *     "Guiding Futures, Shaping Lives" — Mr. Ashutosh Kumar Pandey, IRS, Deputy
 *     Commissioner of Income Tax · Classes IX–XII: "a career-guidance session in
 *     which the officer shared his own educational journey."
 *   data/facilities.ts
 *     Physics · Chemistry · Biology — "Board practicals, Classes IX–XII."
 *     Twelve laboratories, four of them inquiry rooms (Geography, Srijan, Model
 *     United Nations, Active Learning) · two computer labs, 40+ machines each ·
 *     Robotics Lab (drone, 3-D printer, telescope) · Language Lab · Nalanda
