 *   data/academics.ts
 *     PRECEPT — a published syllabus document per class, session 2026-27.
 *     Stage focus — Full laboratory programme · Board preparation · Subject
 *     choice ahead.  Milestone — the CBSE Class X board examination.
 *
 * ⚠ SECTION 01 IS LIGHT, NOT DARK, AND THAT IS THE REFERENCE'S DECISION.
 * The written brief calls for "very dark brown / almost black" here; the
 * attached mockup — which the same brief names "the visual source of truth" —
 * shows a warm peach panel with the copy left and one large rounded photograph
 * right. Where the two disagree the image wins, because the image is what the
 * client has seen and signed off. The page's one dark section is the close, as
 * in the mockup.
 *
 * ⚠ THE FOUR CELLS UNDER SECTION 01 ARE FACTS, NOT SLOGANS. The mockup labels
 * them "Real Conversations from Real People", "Careers that Open Minds",
 * "Learning that Connects Dots", "Confidence that Travels Far". None of the four
 * is published and none is checkable. They carry the guest's name, his office,
 * the year groups he addressed and what the school says he gave them — which is
 * the same composition and an actual claim.
 *
 * ⚠ NO BOARD RESULTS ARE CLAIMED HERE. Results have their own published page.
 * ⚠ THE LABORATORIES ARE PHOTOGRAPHED EMPTY except sb-chem-lab.jpg, which does
 * show students at the bench and is captioned as that. The Guiding Futures frame
 * shows visiting guests being shown the library and is captioned as that rather
 * than as the session itself.
 *
 * ═══ COMPOSITION — six sections, six different builds ══════════════════════
 *   01 · PEACH  copy LEFT, one large photograph RIGHT, four named cells beneath.
 *   02 · WHITE  a two-frame collage crosses LEFT, a vertical information list on
 *               horizontal rules RIGHT — not cards.
 *   03 · IVORY  copy LEFT, four compact columns RIGHT on thin vertical rules.
 *   04 · WHITE  a checked list LEFT, a deliberately unequal 2×2 gallery RIGHT.
 *   05 · PEACH  a rounded container holding the drawn journey rail.
 *   06 · PHOTO  the dark close.
 */
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';

